<title>USA: USDA's Glickman to attend APEC meeting in Manila.</title>
<headline>USDA's Glickman to attend APEC meeting in Manila.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Secretary Dan Glickman was slated to attend the annual Asia Pacific Economic Cooperation forum this weekend in Manila, an aide said Tuesday.</p>
<p>Attendance would underscore the importance of U.S. agrcultural exports, said the aide.</p>
<p>The Pacific Rim is one of the largest regional markets for U.S. farm exports, with Japan the biggest importer.</p>
<p>During the meeting, the countries were expected to finalize commitments to lower trade and investment barriers.</p>
</text>
